 like Shartha.<br /> <br /> The Bee Host can be found here: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/8999-shartha-bharsalu-the-bee-host\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...u-the-bee-host</a><br /> <br /> As for the others I already made, they were on the old site, but I can repost them here if you're interested.<br /> <br /> EDIT: And now I've just remembered you were one of those who contributed to some of those old threads. Silly me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 05-23-2014, 07:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T17:22:30-07:00","id":147305,"title":"","content":"Sure!<br /> <br /> I like Hosts too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T12:08:10-07:00","id":148016,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/144066-looking-for-fanmade-wolf-host?p=147262#post147262\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I've heard of the last, but could you link the others?</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://www.thehowlingvoid.com/nwod-wtf-roaches.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.thehowlingvoid.com/nwod-wtf-roaches.html</a> - Roaches<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/defaultb12c.html?g=posts&amp;t=80427\" target=\"_blank\">http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/d...=posts&amp;t=80427</a> - Leeches<br /> <br /> As for the Octopus Host, I cannot find a link to them online. I had it on a Word Document with no recognition as to who did either. I can post it but cannot give credit where it is due. Pretty sure they are from the old forums but I cant find them after about a half hour of searching. If anyone else can post a link to them, I would be grateful.<br /> <br /> Also while looking for links (Had all these on a Word Doc,) I found this:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/defaultccb4.html?g=posts&amp;t=73794\" target=\"_blank\">http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/d...=posts&amp;t=73794</a> - Snakes<br /> <br /> As for the Spore Hosts and Rabbit Hosts, look up the F.E.A.R. Corporation books from <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/</a><br /> <br /> In the D.E.A.T.H. book/Revised F.E.A.R. (About a third of the way down the Fan Books tab,) the <b>Grei\u2019zul, </b>are Spore Hosts and the <b>Ahrair\u2019ah </b>are the Rabbit Hosts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/213-darkhunter","name":"Darkhunter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar213_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T12:47:58-07:00","id":148052,"title":"","content":"Hey, here's my old stuff. Thanks, this way I only have to post the Locust one: you saved me some time there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T13:30:43-07:00","id":148087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <